    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Turnkey luxury on a grand scale.\r\n\r\nNo. 9 Moynalvy Manor is a spectacular 5-bedroom detached residence spanning an impressive 309.85 sq. m. Combining flawless modern interiors with a fantastic B3 energy rating, this home offers ultimate family comfort in a pristine village setting. \r\n\r\nThe Highlights\r\nThe Living Space: A bright, welcoming hallway leads to a massive sitting room and a show-stopping open-plan kitchen/dining area—the ultimate family hub.\r\nBespoke Bedrooms: Five individually styled bedrooms, including a luxury family bathroom complete with a jacuzzi bath.\r\nThe Bonus Level: The clever dormer floor features a massive c.76.90 sq. mtrs. of secondary living space, plus a 5th bedroom with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\nThe Outdoors: A completely private, un-overlooked rear oasis featuring manicured lawns, a natural stone patio, and a gorgeous feature pergola. Includes a secure gated cobble lock driveway and a large, detached garage.\r\n \r\nLocation Everything\r\n\r\nEnjoy the peace of Moynalvy village with effortless access to Summerhill, Dunboyne and Kilcock. Top schools, shopping, dining, and easy Dublin commuter links are all just minutes away. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Strictly by appointment through the sole selling agents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nENTERANCE PORCH: c.0.92 x 2.33m\r\nLight fitting, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nHALLWAY: c. 4.10 x 2.36 & 1.17 x 9.80m\r\nCoving, light fittings, wooden floor, phone point.\r\n\r\nSITTING/DINING/LIVING ROOM: c.8.93 x 4.38m\r\nCoving, light fittings, Venetian blinds, curtains, TV/cable point, features a bay window, wooden floor, double doors leading to conservatory.\r\n\r\nCONSERVATORY: c.5.12 x 3.71m\r\nLight fittings, wooden floor, TV/cable point, electric wall mounted fire, double doors leading to garden area.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN: c.5.70 x 5.07m\r\nCoving, light fittings, fitted units, quartz splash back  & counter tops, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, island unit, tiled floor, build in bar.\r\n\r\nUTILITY ROOM: c.2.97 x 1.97m\r\nLight fitting, fitted units, area plumbed, tiled floor, door leading to garden area.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM: c. 3.96 x 3.00m\r\nLight fittings, fully tiled, WC, WHB, corner bath with jacuzzi, cubicle with Aspirante electric shower\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c.3.96 x 4.06m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes with vanity unit, blind, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.2.44 x 0.99m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, cubicle with mains shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2: 3.81 x 4.66m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes with vanity unit, Venetian blinds, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.0.99 x 2.44m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, cubicle with mains shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: 3.76 x 3.73m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes, Venetian blinds, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.2.00 x 1.84m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, corner unit with mains shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 4: c.3.67 x 4.48m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes, Venetian blinds, curtains, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.1.96 x 1.83m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, corner unit with mains shower, WC, WHB, tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLANDING: c. 4.77 x 1.40m\r\nLight fittings, wooden floor, Velux window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 5: c.4.80 x 5.44\r\nLight fittings, TV/cable point, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nWALK-IN WARDROBE: c. 4.78 x 1.68m\r\nLight fitting, storage racking, wooden floor.\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c. 2.18 x 1.94m\r\nLight fitting, fully tiled, WC, WHB, walk-in shower, heated towel rail.\r\n\r\nLOUNGE: c.4.96 x 7.59m\r\nLight fittings, 2 x Velux windows, storage, wooden flooring, TV/cable point."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "INTERNAL FEATURES\r\nAll curtains and carpets included in sale\r\nAll blinds included in sale\r\nAll light fittings included in sale\r\nProperty fully alarmed\r\nSome appliances included in sale\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL FEATURES\r\nPVC double glazed windows\r\nPVC facia and soffits\r\nOutside tap\r\nOutside light\r\nSecurity lights\r\nPergola\r\nDecking area\r\nLandscaped gardens\r\nFront gates\r\nLocated in quiet cul de sac\r\nProperty not overlooked to front/rear\r\nCobble lock driveway\r\nOnsite parking\r\nGarage\r\n\r\nSERVICES/HEATING:\t\r\nMains water \r\nMains sewerage\r\nCondensing boiler\r\nO.F.C.H.\r\n\r\nFLOOR AREA: c.309.85 sq. mtrs.\r\n\r\nPROPERTY AGE: 2000\r\n\r\nBER RATING: B3\r\n\r\nBER NUMBER: 119148088\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER: All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permission for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any intending purchaser or tenant should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy himself/herself by inspection or    otherwise as to the correctness of each of them."
